    "head_commit_message": "perf(sim): the per-squad quadratics found in 10b-ii, fixed (spec 39 step 10b-iii)\n\nA flank's edge units are read from a tree of maxima over the lines\nsorted by start and end, not by comparing every pair. The swaps'\nclaims, the busy units and the joined are looked up, not searched.\nOutcomes don't change.\n\nRefs #557\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5V5gckMRiP4ExcSvA",
